* Quality check variables from the bot-detection service (QOS_*).
* Run on a Decipher SPSS export of a tracked survey. Safe to run more than once.
* Blank QOS values are system-missing: the respondent did not reach the last page,
* the check did not apply, or the service did not answer in time (QOS_FLAG = 'unknown').

VALUE LABELS QOS_STATUS 1 'Human' 2 'Suspect' 3 'Bot'
 /QOS_DUP QOS_DATACENTER 0 'No' 1 'Yes'
 /QOS_REASON
   0 'None'
   1 'Automated or headless browser'
   2 'Clicks and key presses generated by script'
   3 'Pages answered with no mouse or keyboard use'
   4 'Hidden honeypot field filled in'
   5 'Open ends that appeared without typing'
   6 'Bot-like behaviour score'
   7 'Typing or mouse movement with machine-exact timing'
   8 'Page times longer than the time the server saw'
   10 'Data centre, VPN or proxy IP address'
   11 'Same device seen on other sessions of this survey'
   12 'Same IP address used repeatedly'
   13 'Answers copied from another respondent'
   14 'Many surveys started in a short time'
   15 'Same respondent seen from different countries within an hour'
   20 'Low-quality open-ended answers'
   21 'Straight-lined grid questions'
   22 'Questions answered too fast'.

* QOS_SCORE arrives as text (0 to 1); this makes a numeric copy.
COMPUTE QOS_SCORE_N = NUMBER(QOS_SCORE, F8.4).
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_SCORE_N 'Quality check score 0-1 (numeric)'.
FORMATS QOS_SCORE_N (F6.2).

* One 0/1 variable per reason code, from the comma-separated QOS_REASONS.
COMPUTE QOS_R1 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',1,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R1 'Reason 1: Automated or headless browser'.
COMPUTE QOS_R2 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',2,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R2 'Reason 2: Clicks and key presses generated by script'.
COMPUTE QOS_R3 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',3,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R3 'Reason 3: Pages answered with no mouse or keyboard use'.
COMPUTE QOS_R4 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',4,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R4 'Reason 4: Hidden honeypot field filled in'.
COMPUTE QOS_R5 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',5,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R5 'Reason 5: Open ends that appeared without typing'.
COMPUTE QOS_R6 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',6,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R6 'Reason 6: Bot-like behaviour score'.
COMPUTE QOS_R7 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',7,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R7 'Reason 7: Typing or mouse movement with machine-exact timing'.
COMPUTE QOS_R8 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',8,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R8 'Reason 8: Page times longer than the time the server saw'.
COMPUTE QOS_R10 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',10,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R10 'Reason 10: Data centre, VPN or proxy IP address'.
COMPUTE QOS_R11 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',11,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R11 'Reason 11: Same device seen on other sessions of this survey'.
COMPUTE QOS_R12 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',12,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R12 'Reason 12: Same IP address used repeatedly'.
COMPUTE QOS_R13 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',13,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R13 'Reason 13: Answers copied from another respondent'.
COMPUTE QOS_R14 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',14,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R14 'Reason 14: Many surveys started in a short time'.
COMPUTE QOS_R15 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',15,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R15 'Reason 15: Same respondent seen from different countries within an hour'.
COMPUTE QOS_R20 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',20,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R20 'Reason 20: Low-quality open-ended answers'.
COMPUTE QOS_R21 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',21,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R21 'Reason 21: Straight-lined grid questions'.
COMPUTE QOS_R22 = CHAR.INDEX(CONCAT(',', RTRIM(QOS_REASONS), ','), ',22,') > 0.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_R22 'Reason 22: Questions answered too fast'.
FORMATS QOS_R1 TO QOS_R22 (F1.0).
VALUE LABELS QOS_R1 TO QOS_R22 0 'No' 1 'Yes'.

* Suggested cleaning flag: keep humans, review suspects, remove bots.
RECODE QOS_STATUS (1=1) (2=2) (3=3) (SYSMIS=9) INTO QOS_ACTION.
VARIABLE LABELS QOS_ACTION 'Suggested action'.
VALUE LABELS QOS_ACTION 1 'Keep' 2 'Review' 3 'Remove' 9 'Not checked - see dashboard'.
FORMATS QOS_ACTION (F1.0).

FREQUENCIES QOS_STATUS QOS_FLAG QOS_REASON QOS_ACTION.
EXECUTE.
